       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TPMDELTASK.
       AUTHOR.                 W. ROXBURY.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.           JANUARY, 1995
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *   TPMDELTASK  -  THIS PROGRAM WILL DELETE TASK ENTRIES FROM
      *                  A PM MASTER JOBPLAN WHICH HAVE SPACES IN
      *                  THE LINE FIELD.
      *   NOTE:  THIS IS A TEMPORARY UTILITY PROGRAM TO REPAIR BAD
      *          DATA AT A PLANT UNTIL THE BUG WHICH IS WRITING THE
      *          BAD RECORDS IS FOUND AND REPAIRED.
      **************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT PM-JOBPLAN
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM4101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  PM-JOBPLAN
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  PM-JOBPLAN-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4101.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STAT.
           05  FILE-STAT-1     PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STAT-2     PIC X  VALUE "0".

       01  DB-ERROR.
           05  DB-TYPE         PIC X(08) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DB-FILE         PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER          PIC X(21)
                               VALUE " ERROR - COND-WORD = ".
           05  CON-WORD        PIC -9999.

       01  PM-JOBPLAN-DATA.
           COPY DPMJBPLN       IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       BEGIN.
           OPEN I-O            PM-JOBPLAN.

       GET-RECORD-FIRST.
           MOVE SPACES         TO PM-JOBPLAN-DATA.
           READ PM-JOBPLAN     FIRST INTO PM-JOBPLAN-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
               GO TO END-OF-JOB
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "READ FST" TO DB-TYPE
               DISPLAY DB-ERROR
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

           GO TO PROCESS-RECORD.

       GET-RECORD-NEXT.
           MOVE SPACES         TO PM-JOBPLAN-DATA.
           READ PM-JOBPLAN     NEXT INTO PM-JOBPLAN-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
               GO TO END-OF-JOB
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "READ NXT" TO DB-TYPE
               DISPLAY DB-ERROR
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       PROCESS-RECORD.
           IF PMJP-LINE = "    "
               PERFORM DELETE-LINE.

           GO TO GET-RECORD-NEXT.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               PM-JOBPLAN.
           GOBACK.

       DELETE-LINE.
           DELETE PM-JOBPLAN
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               MOVE FILE-STAT  TO CON-WORD
               MOVE "DELETE  " TO DB-TYPE
               DISPLAY DB-ERROR
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

      *******************>>>  END OF FILE  <<<*********************
